+PROVED finite weighted certificate for the BEST positive Paley escape, X=65536, q=257, exact saved factor: the analytic all-circle lower bound is -257-free expression -(256)/(4*sqrt(514))-1/4, enclosed by -3.0729189849038777010105473227513157820854675503393647 with Arb radius below 3.3e-53. A 180-bit Arb evaluation at x=2*pi*2078304/4194304 encloses the value -3.07242066887755174830315100621001527283224240 with radius below 5.6e-45. Thus its global minimum is rigorously bracketed between these two balls. This is a weighted polynomial, not a binary set.
